<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6019] The metrics data for the number of scanned rows in pushdown queries is lost</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6019</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The operator types for scanning data contained in the generated SparkPlan are not fully covered when calculating `scanRows` and `scanBytes`. In the current case, this is due to the lack of accumulation of metrics for `HiveTableScanExecTransformer`.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
